<ttl id="1002J_S000U_744TG_T0089" variety="T0089">
<name>ABS with EBD &amp; TRC &amp; VSC &amp; BA System</name>
<para id="RM00000060R00QX" category="C" type-id="300DZ" name-id="442OO-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>C1246/46</dtccode>
<dtcname>Master Pressure Sensor Signal System Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM00000060R00QX_05" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00007QH00000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.28in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.22in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.58in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Output Related Items</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C1246/46</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>At a vehicle speed of 7km/h or more with PMC terminal voltage exceeding 0.86V, a condition with no change of 0.005V or more continues for 30 seconds</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>At a vehicle speed of 10Km/h or more, noise to the PMC terminal occurs 7 times or more in 5 seconds</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>When the stop light switch is OFF, PMC terminal voltage remains above 0.86V or below 0.27V for 5 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>With IG1 terminal voltage at 9.5to17.2V, VCM terminal voltage remains outside 4.4to5.6V for 1.2 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>With VCM terminal voltage at 4.8to5.2V, PMC terminal voltage remains outside 0.19to4.57V for 1.2 seconds or more</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Master pressure sensor malfunction in actuator</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Stop light circuit</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Stop Light Switch</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Open or short in wire harness</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Poor connector contact pressure, terminal deformation or corrosion</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Actuator assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000060R00QX_06" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___00007QI00000">
