</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000060R00QX_07" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM00000060R00QX_08" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM00000060R00QX_08_0008" proc-id="RM0550J___00007QJ00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Stop Light Illumination</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON, depress the brake pedal, and check that the stop lights come on.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Comes on</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000060R00QX_08_0009" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000060R00QX_08_0013" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060R00QX_08_0009" proc-id="RM0550J___00007QK00000">
<scantool type="4"/>
<testtitle>ECU Data Monitor (Stop Light Switch, Master Cylinder Pressure Sensor 1)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using the SST (TaSCAN), inspect the data monitor for the stop light switch and master pressure sensor. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000602011X"/>)</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>ECU Data Monitor</title>
<tgroup cols="4">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<colspec colname="COL4" colwidth="1.77in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Name</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item Description</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Specified Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Stop Switch</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Indicates stop light switch operation</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Brake pedal depressed ←→ released</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ON←→OFF</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Master Pressure Sensor 1</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Indicates master pressure sensor output</ptxt>
<ptxt>Display range: 0to5V</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Brake pedal operated</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Changes in proportion to pedal force in the range of 0.14 to 4.85V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM00000060R00QX_08_0010" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM00000060R00QX_08_0012" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM00000060R00QX_08_0010" proc-id="RM0550J___00007QL00000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Recheck DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear the DTCs, perform a driving and braking test, and output the DTCs. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000060000PX"/>)</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Result</title>
